Sending: was quite pale (with passion, Alice thought), and it said in a low
Sending: trembling voice, “Let us get to the shore, and then I’ll tell you my
Sending: history, and you’ll understand why it is I hate cats and dogs.”
Sending: 
Sending: It was high time to go, for the pool was getting quite crowded with the
Sending: birds and animals that had fallen into it: there were a Duck and a
Sending: Dodo, a Lory and an Eaglet, and several other curious creatures. Alice
Sending: led the way, and the whole party swam to the shore.
