Sending: 
Sending: “I wish I hadn’t mentioned Dinah!” she said to herself in a melancholy
Sending: tone. “Nobody seems to like her, down here, and I’m sure she’s the best
Sending: cat in the world! Oh, my dear Dinah! I wonder if I shall ever see you
