Sending: “Well, I should like to be a _little_ larger, sir, if you wouldn’t
Sending: mind,” said Alice: “three inches is such a wretched height to be.”
Sending: 
Sending: “It is a very good height indeed!” said the Caterpillar angrily,
Sending: rearing itself upright as it spoke (it was exactly three inches high).
Sending: 
Sending: “But I’m not used to it!” pleaded poor Alice in a piteous tone. And she
Sending: thought of herself, “I wish the creatures wouldn’t be so easily
Sending: offended!”
Sending: 
Sending: “You’ll get used to it in time,” said the Caterpillar; and it put the
Sending: hookah into its mouth and began smoking again.
