Sending: drawing of a muchness?”
Sending: 
Sending: “Really, now you ask me,” said Alice, very much confused, “I don’t
Sending: think—”
Sending: 
Sending: “Then you shouldn’t talk,” said the Hatter.
Sending: 
Sending: This piece of rudeness was more than Alice could bear: she got up in
Sending: great disgust, and walked off; the Dormouse fell asleep instantly, and
Sending: neither of the others took the least notice of her going, though she
