Sending: all my life!”
Sending: 
Sending: Just as she said this, she noticed that one of the trees had a door
Sending: leading right into it. “That’s very curious!” she thought. “But
Sending: everything’s curious today. I think I may as well go in at once.” And
Sending: in she went.
Sending: 
Sending: Once more she found herself in the long hall, and close to the little
Sending: glass table. “Now, I’ll manage better this time,” she said to herself,
Sending: and began by taking the little golden key, and unlocking the door that
Sending: led into the garden. Then she went to work nibbling at the mushroom
