Sending: CHAPTER IX.
Sending: The Mock Turtle’s Story
Sending: 
Sending: 
Sending: “You can’t think how glad I am to see you again, you dear old thing!”
Sending: said the Duchess, as she tucked her arm affectionately into Alice’s,
Sending: and they walked off together.
